/// kind is visited as a distinct entity (no hidden collapses):
/// Vertex -> Edge,  Edge -> CoEdge,  CoEdge -> Wire,  Wire -> Face,
/// Face -> Shell,  Shell -> Solid,  Solid -> CompSolid/Compound,
